    // lua_chunk_grammar, both unbuilt; when srv1_serving_api_key_substitution_node lands this reads
    // DissolutionFired and the row retires. Why it did not simply land in this PR: the wrapper body is
    // a verbatim retention of the script srv1 RUNS (sha256-pinned in
    // gunbc.host.srv1_serving_startup_receipt); under the operator hold I may neither rewrite that
    // observation nor relaunch the container to prove the render. The render is modelable now — the
